      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>While moogle legends describe Moggle Mog as a kind, benevolent presence, the primal summoned by Mooglesguard is driven by the need to feast on ever-greater amounts of aether along with a large following to further solidify his being. - Moggle Mog</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 27, touch 20, flat-footed 18 (+1 size, +9 dex, +3 armor, +4 natural)</p><p>HP 84 [143] (13d10+13)</p><p>Fort +9, Ref +17, Will +11</p><p>Weakness Shadow</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft., fly 30 ft. (good)</p><p>Ranged +1 Longbow +25/+20/+15 (1d6+9/x3)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>STR 8, DEX 28, CON 12, INT 20, WIS 24, CHA 16</p><p>Base Atk +13; CMB +11; CMD +30</p><p>Feats Clustered Shots, Improved Precise Shot, Manyshot, Point-Blank Shot, Precise Shot, Rapid Shot, Weapon Focus (Longbow)</p><p>Skills Fly +29</p><p>SQ Outsider traits, Does not Breathe, Does not Eat, Does not Sleep</p>"
